{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksTitle","en":"How does AWA Together work?"},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksDescription","en":"Learn how the app lets you support your partner while respecting her privacy."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksParagraph1","en":"AWA Together lets you view only the information your partner has chosen to share with you."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksParagraph2","en":"For example, you may see some information about her cycle, her next period, or her fertile window when sharing is turned on for them."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksParagraph3","en":"The information visible always depends on her choices. She can change what she shares at any time."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoTitle","en":"Why is some information hidden?"},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoDescription","en":"Your partner chooses what she shares with you. She can change these choices at any time."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoParagraph1","en":"Your partner keeps control over the information she wants to share with you."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoParagraph2","en":"If information doesn’t appear in your space, it may simply mean she hasn’t chosen to share it."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoParagraph3","en":"Her choices can change at any time. AWA Together only shows you the information you currently have access to."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.understandingTitle","en":"Understanding the shared information"},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.understandingDescription","en":"Simple explanations of cycle day, current phase, fertile window, estimated ovulation, and next period."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.understandingIntro","en":"Here’s what the information shared with you can mean:"},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termCycleDay","en":"Cycle day"},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionCycleDay","en":"Indicates the number of days since the start of her last period."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termCurrentPhase","en":"Current phase"},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionCurrentPhase","en":"Indicates the current stage of the cycle when available."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termFertileWindow","en":"Fertile window"},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionFertileWindow","en":"Estimated period during which the probability of conception may be higher."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termOvulation","en":"Estimated ovulation"},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionOvulation","en":"Estimate of when ovulation occurs, based on the available information."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termNextPeriod","en":"Estimated next period"},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionNextPeriod","en":"Estimated date of the start of her next period."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termPeriodStatus","en":"Period status"},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionPeriodStatus","en":"Indicates whether her period is currently in progress or finished."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingTitle","en":"I’m having a problem with AWA Together"},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingDescription","en":"What to do if information isn’t showing, the connection seems interrupted, or you have another issue."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingParagraph1","en":"If some information isn’t showing, start by checking that your internet connection is working properly."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingParagraph2","en":"Some information may also be missing simply because your partner isn’t currently sharing it."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingParagraph3","en":"You can also try closing and reopening the app."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingParagraph4","en":"If the problem persists, you’ll be able to contact AWA support."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.contactSupportTitle","en":"Contact support"},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.contactSupportDescription","en":"Need more help? Our team is here to support you."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.contactSupportParagraph1","en":"If you have a question, run into a problem, or want to give us feedback, you can contact the AWA team from this section."},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.contactSupportParagraph2","en":"Thank you for helping us improve AWA! 💜"},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.contactButton","en":"Write to us"},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.contactAccessibility","en":"Contact us by email"},
{"k":"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.contactEmailSubject","en":"Help — AWA Together"},
